          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择有分组资料的考核。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请选择任务所属的子分组；上级分组只用来汇总。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the subgroup that contains the task. Parent groups are used for totals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择任务所属的子分组；上级分组只用来汇总。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分组结构或各项占比无法核对，暂不能合成课程总评。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The group structure or the shares could not be verified, so no course total is shown."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分组结构或各项占比无法核对，暂不能合成课程总评。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已有成绩缺少可换算的满分或采用等级制，不能按百分制合成总评。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A grade has no usable maximum or is a letter grade, so it cannot be combined into a percentage."
