    "补充课程会按所选时段显示在「今日」和「计划」，不会写入校宝。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added courses appear in Today and Planner at the time you choose. They are not sent to Schoolis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补充课程会按所选时段显示在「今日」和「计划」，不会写入校宝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「今日」和「计划」中补齐住校夜的作息。走读生自己参加的课程和晚自习也会显示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include boarding routines in Today and Planner on nights spent at school. Day students still see their own classes and evening study."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「今日」和「计划」中补齐住校夜的作息。走读生自己参加的课程和晚自习也会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
