    "只改变本机「今日」和「计划」的显示，不改选课、提醒或实时活动。外考课程不包括考试日程。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These choices only affect Today and Planner on this device. Enrollments, reminders and Live Activities stay the same. External exam courses do not include exam events."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改变本机「今日」和「计划」的显示，不改选课、提醒或实时活动。外考课程不包括考试日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
