    "关闭 TSSA 后，已排定的那一节按晚自习显示。若也关闭晚自习，则两者都不显示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When TSSA is hidden, its scheduled period appears as evening study. Turn off evening study as well to hide both."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭 TSSA 后，已排定的那一节按晚自习显示。若也关闭晚自习，则两者都不显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
