    "请仅在设有锁屏密码的个人 iPad 上开启。密码存入本机钥匙串，不同步到 iCloud。打开 App 或主动查看 GPA 时，优先沿用校宝会话；确实需要登录时才使用保存的账号和密码一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use this only on a personal iPad with a passcode. Your password stays in this iPad’s Keychain and doesn’t sync to iCloud. When you open the app or check GPA, it reuses your Xiaobao session first. It uses the saved account and password once only if a new sign-in is needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请仅在设有锁屏密码的个人 iPad 上开启。密码存入本机钥匙串，不同步到 iCloud。打开 App 或主动查看 GPA 时，优先沿用校宝会话；确实需要登录时才使用保存的账号和密码一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
